{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gooey </strong>is a precision platformer where you squish, swing, and fling your way through vibrant, momentum-based levels using your elastic grappling arm. Inspired by Celeste, Super Meat Boy, and the creative spirit of Mario Maker, Gooey was lab-grown with tight controls, satisfying movement, and an ever-expanding world of user-generated challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STRETCHY ARM GRAPPLING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab walls, swing from pulley belts, and slingshot yourself across gaps with your sticky extendable arm (a goopling hook, if you will).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689150/extras/b85f683f86780aa3339e8f17519be308.poster.avif?t=1760690478\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689150/extras/b85f683f86780aa3339e8f17519be308.webm?t=1760690478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689150/extras/b85f683f86780aa3339e8f17519be308.mp4?t=1760690478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PIPE LAUNCHERS &amp; MOVING BELTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain together movement in and out of zooming pipes and spinning belts for flowing platforming combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689150/extras/b879e6e61789215e41a30d4cd1ce578f.poster.avif?t=1760690478\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689150/extras/b879e6e61789215e41a30d4cd1ce578f.webm?t=1760690478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689150/extras/b879e6e61789215e41a30d4cd1ce578f.mp4?t=1760690478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HAZARDS &amp; MOMENTUM CHALLENGES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge electric beams, time your gooples/swings, and link your movement with satisfying precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COLLECTIBLES &amp; GOALS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the L, A, and B letters in each level before reaching the beacon, just like the best to platforming classics, to show off Gooey\u2019s platforming prowess!.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689150/extras/5158096f5cb0da83d58ab8c3fe92b0c4.poster.avif?t=1760690478\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689150/extras/5158096f5cb0da83d58ab8c3fe92b0c4.webm?t=1760690478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689150/extras/5158096f5cb0da83d58ab8c3fe92b0c4.mp4?t=1760690478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LEVEL EDITOR + WORKSHOP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create, play, and share custom levels with full <strong>Steam Workshop</strong> support, from chill obstacle courses to races against the clock and evil precision gauntlets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a speedrunner, casual goo-flinger, or aspiring level designer, <strong>Gooey</strong> is a playground of sticky, satisfying movement and endless community creativity at your stretchy fingertips!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3689150?t=1760690478","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689150/45211a9804782c0b666212f9d66c66ce4f45c85a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760690478","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689150/d518f4bd4b8e0b4c410f4dbc7d097420344fd4be/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760690478","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689150/d518f4bd4b8e0b4c410f4dbc7d097420344fd4be/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760690478","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3984510,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gooey </strong>is a precision platformer where you squish, swing, and fling your way through vibrant, momentum-based levels using your elastic grappling arm. Inspired by Celeste, Super Meat Boy, and the creative spirit of Mario Maker, Gooey was lab-grown with tight controls, satisfying movement, and an ever-expanding world of user-generated challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STRETCHY ARM GRAPPLING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab walls, swing from pulley belts, and slingshot yourself across gaps with your sticky extendable arm (a goopling hook, if you will).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689150/extras/b85f683f86780aa3339e8f17519be308.poster.avif?t=1760690478\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689150/extras/b85f683f86780aa3339e8f17519be308.webm?t=1760690478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689150/extras/b85f683f86780aa3339e8f17519be308.mp4?t=1760690478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PIPE LAUNCHERS &amp; MOVING BELTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain together movement in and out of zooming pipes and spinning belts for flowing platforming combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689150/extras/b879e6e61789215e41a30d4cd1ce578f.poster.avif?t=1760690478\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689150/extras/b879e6e61789215e41a30d4cd1ce578f.webm?t=1760690478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689150/extras/b879e6e61789215e41a30d4cd1ce578f.mp4?t=1760690478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HAZARDS &amp; MOMENTUM CHALLENGES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge electric beams, time your gooples/swings, and link your movement with satisfying precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COLLECTIBLES &amp; GOALS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the L, A, and B letters in each level before reaching the beacon, just like the best to platforming classics, to show off Gooey\u2019s platforming prowess!.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689150/extras/5158096f5cb0da83d58ab8c3fe92b0c4.poster.avif?t=1760690478\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689150/extras/5158096f5cb0da83d58ab8c3fe92b0c4.webm?t=1760690478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689150/extras/5158096f5cb0da83d58ab8c3fe92b0c4.mp4?t=1760690478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LEVEL EDITOR + WORKSHOP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create, play, and share custom levels with full <strong>Steam Workshop</strong> support, from chill obstacle courses to races against the clock and evil precision gauntlets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a speedrunner, casual goo-flinger, or aspiring level designer, <strong>Gooey</strong> is a playground of sticky, satisfying movement and endless community creativity at your stretchy fingertips!</p>","developers":["OG Pixel"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689150/09697ee8c9880fe2511e54c51c1e3ff92202b9c0/header.jpg?t=1760690478","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS Catalina<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS Catalina<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstat